pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 20]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 2 · YOUR SETUP — STEP 1 OF 4}
  - elementId: stepnum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 90, 110, 60]
    content: {style: "$stepnum", wrap: false, text: "1"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 96, 726, 44]
    content: {style: "$title", fontSize: 27, wrap: false, text: Register your team, save the handout, open IRIS}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 160, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1 832,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: do-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 182, 300, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: DO THIS NOW}
  - elementId: steps
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 210, 500, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      text: |
        <p><strong>1.</strong> One captain opens
        <strong>https://ctfd.cyberexperts.org/silent-ridge/register</strong> and enters the enrollment code.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>2.</strong> Bookmark the private retrieval page and use
        <strong>Print / save handout</strong>. It is the team's way back to every generated login.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>3.</strong> Open <strong>https://iris.cyberexperts.org</strong>,
        log in with the team IRIS credentials, and confirm that the ticket queue opens.</p>
  - elementId: check-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 210, 2, 220]
    viewBox: [2, 220]
    points: "1,0 1,220"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: check-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 182, 272, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: HOW TO CHECK}
  - elementId: check-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 210, 272, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>You see a list of tickets with statuses like <strong>available</strong>.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">Registration pending? Keep the retrieval page open; it updates when the three desktops and accounts are ready.</p>
  - elementId: why-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [624, 350, 272, 80]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: IRIS is where your team claims work. CTFd questions appear only for tickets your team has activated.
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "6"}
